{"concept":"great-noon","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":40}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-120ff3cf947dd29de9b8c4c8c3a13b5b","tos.text-unit.sid-120ff3cf947dd29de9b8c4c8c3a13b5b"]},"form":"Vormittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель сравнивает ясность души с утренними горами.","en":"The teacher compares his soul’s clarity to morning mountains."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-167e36b80b772911dbb77be48147b78e","tos.text-unit.sid-167e36b80b772911dbb77be48147b78e"]},"form":"Vormittag","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["agency"],"line":{"ru":"Позднее пробуждение открывает учителю новую истину.","en":"A late awakening opens a new truth to the teacher."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e","tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","attention","circle","ring","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень открывает союз кружащего орла и обвившей его змеи.","en":"Noon reveals the bond of the circling eagle and coiled snake."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5c2ae9f748ada5b2d48fff9fb13a701f","tos.text-unit.sid-5c2ae9f748ada5b2d48fff9fb13a701f"]},"form":"Vormittags","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra","listeners"],"line":{"ru":"Дневная тяжесть жизни сопоставлена с гордостью и вечерним смирением.","en":"Life’s daily weight is set beside pride and evening resignation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-474041af8e46b8564e0b60045b07e736","tos.text-unit.sid-474041af8e46b8564e0b60045b07e736"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дети одной надежды приглашаются к празднику полдня.","en":"Children of one hope are invited to noon’s festival."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-141fcbf511cfb1dfc36bb084891e48b0","tos.text-unit.sid-141fcbf511cfb1dfc36bb084891e48b0"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Великий полдень празднует середину пути к сверхчеловеку.","en":"Great noon celebrates the midpoint of the path to overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3a6801215ba78a0dc2f5b55cfb86379c","tos.text-unit.sid-3a6801215ba78a0dc2f5b55cfb86379c"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","affirmation","identity","going-under","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Уходящий благословляет себя как переходящего.","en":"The one going under blesses himself as one passing over."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4526c85af8b25eef16ed2c2dac290d69","tos.text-unit.sid-4526c85af8b25eef16ed2c2dac290d69"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","will","death-of-god","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Последняя воля полдня желает жизни сверхчеловека.","en":"Noon’s final will desires the overman’s life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-14f76092fc21047844b181e359e0508b","tos.text-unit.sid-14f76092fc21047844b181e359e0508b"]},"form":"Nachmittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учения предлагаются друзьям созревшими плодами осени.","en":"Teachings are offered to friends as ripe autumn fruits."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2c742cf66a66784dc30a76f932cad2f4","tos.text-unit.sid-2c742cf66a66784dc30a76f932cad2f4"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель переживает себя летним полднем.","en":"The teacher experiences himself as summer noon."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d517b1c59d07114c0e4f6117c8268ed3","tos.text-unit.sid-d517b1c59d07114c0e4f6117c8268ed3"]},"form":"Mittags","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","flying-apparition"],"line":{"ru":"Полуденный двойник Заратустры возвещает высшее время.","en":"Zarathustra’s noontime double announces the highest time."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0f931cad7efb80dddd0d9fa637de9e27","tos.text-unit.sid-1d1e6d8ca5971f35985ef3f0ba650b09"]},"form":"Nachmittag","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","will"],"line":{"ru":"Преодолённая боль даёт учителю снова встать на свою судьбу.","en":"Overcome pain lets the teacher stand on his fate again."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c2ece79f3d1e22ff62e155735346f8b7","tos.text-unit.sid-c2ece79f3d1e22ff62e155735346f8b7"]},"form":"Nachmittags","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Встречи друзей вспоминаются часом послеполуденной тишины.","en":"Encounters with friends are remembered as afternoon quiet."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-172d4e1c2be784bb748e8a5099100a65","tos.text-unit.sid-172d4e1c2be784bb748e8a5099100a65"]},"form":"Nachmittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Счастье ищет пристанища в гостеприимных душах.","en":"Happiness seeks shelter in hospitable souls."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aa6969b2cd43f7f83230ae180407c8c0","tos.text-unit.sid-aa6969b2cd43f7f83230ae180407c8c0"]},"form":"Nachmittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель отдаёт многое ради живой посадки мыслей.","en":"The teacher gives much for a living planting of thoughts."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cdc8abc22825f45be69e14035c864c4b","tos.text-unit.sid-cdc8abc22825f45be69e14035c864c4b"]},"form":"Nachmittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Счастье перед вечером становится предметом недоверия.","en":"Happiness before evening becomes a subject of distrust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c835f772aca48af6f6cd13cf85f5ea47","tos.text-unit.sid-c835f772aca48af6f6cd13cf85f5ea47"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Благословенная молния готовит будущих вестников.","en":"Blessed lightning prepares future messengers."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-u