:"Человек празднует свой вечер путём к новым утрам.","en":"The human celebrates evening as a path to new mornings."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6fa41c58545934cf6e3a6b7c6544908c","tos.text-unit.sid-6fa41c58545934cf6e3a6b7c6544908c"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Великий полдень вспоминается среди образов над человеком.","en":"Great noon is recalled among images set above the human."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3795983c7aa5254787deddc2a42d207e","tos.text-unit.sid-3795983c7aa5254787deddc2a42d207e"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель просит зрелости для великого полдня.","en":"The teacher asks for ripeness for great noon."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2e3cfd9f7a3396b3c90ff577880893a7","tos.text-unit.sid-2e3cfd9f7a3396b3c90ff577880893a7"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Зрелость изображена звездой под полуденными стрелами.","en":"Ripeness is pictured as a star under noontime arrows."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ce045055585467cfc09217fef32bfa81","tos.text-unit.sid-03419225d5cdf6f8a5e19876524d7a31"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","recurrence","identity","earth","animals","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Звери воображают повтор той же жизни и всех слов учителя.","en":"The animals imagine the same life and all the teacher’s words repeated."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bfe99dd3c0c63c08a7b68d8e392b26a1","tos.text-unit.sid-bfe99dd3c0c63c08a7b68d8e392b26a1"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Счастье заброшено наживкой людям во все стороны времени суток.","en":"Happiness is cast as bait for people across all hours of the day."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f7037b1168d9420d24d9da9e72f06ce3","tos.text-unit.sid-f7037b1168d9420d24d9da9e72f06ce3"]},"form":"Vormittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"soothsayer","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель прерывает прорицателя образом утренней дождевой тучи.","en":"The teacher interrupts the soothsayer with the image of a morning rain-cloud."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d","tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d"]},"form":"Mittags","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","difference","circle","loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень приводит странника от жажды к желанию покоя.","en":"Noon leads the traveller from thirst to a desire for rest."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b8bb1704f20e2f470b45bd45607c7a70","tos.text-unit.sid-b8bb1704f20e2f470b45bd45607c7a70"]},"form":"Mittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"dream","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Душа ощущает усталость среди зрелых благ полдня.","en":"The soul feels weariness amid noon’s ripe goods."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1d066d4673a192c8aba33c2fb1618a0d","tos.text-unit.sid-1d066d4673a192c8aba33c2fb1618a0d"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"dream","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Полуденная тишина переживается совершенством мира.","en":"Noontime silence is experienced as the world’s perfection."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-81f8171881129a8e2b2488093138ad37","tos.text-unit.sid-81f8171881129a8e2b2488093138ad37"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"dream","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сон полдня изображён глотком счастья.","en":"Noon’s sleep is pictured as a sip of happiness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-80a9f5c4e7087b6c027d1dac74aafb76","tos.text-unit.sid-80a9f5c4e7087b6c027d1dac74aafb76"]},"form":"Mittagsschläfer","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Пробуждение возвращает путнику незавершённую дорогу.","en":"Waking returns the traveller to the unfinished path."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d469b38a6a88e59c52eac58736674368","tos.text-unit.sid-d469b38a6a88e59c52eac58736674368"]},"form":"Mittags","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sky","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Душа спрашивает о возвращении в полуденную бездну вечности.","en":"The soul asks about returning into eternity’s noontime abyss."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88","tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88"]},"form":"Nachmittage","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","necessity","difference","counterfactual","attention"],"line":{"ru":"Многоголосый крик открывает учителю собственную пещеру.","en":"The many-voiced cry reveals the teacher’s own cave to him."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e105be3f43b0fdfca6716c4edea8b0b0","tos.text-unit.sid-e105be3f43b0fdfca6716c4edea8b0b0"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Смерть прежнего Бога открывает приближение великого полдня.","en":"The former God’s death opens great noon’s approach."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3e76a5fb7c7f7ee66ed1399a439cc7c3","tos.text-unit.sid-3e76a5fb7c7f7ee66ed1399a439cc7c3"]},"form":"Nachmittage","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Зрелость мира выражена виноградом и осенним сердцем.","en":"The world’s ripeness is expressed through grapes and an autumnal heart."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-114fac54469e178ddaf1cd9dc82e0d9b","tos.text-unit.sid-114fac54469e178ddaf1cd9dc82e0d9b"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Полночь вспоминает ушедшие юность, полдень и вечер.","en":"Midnight recalls departed youth, noon and evening."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5f381b80bfad6238fb6fd67fb88e03f1","tos.text-unit.sid-5f381b80bfad6238fb6fd67fb88e03f1"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","attention","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ночная полнота мира получает также имя полдня.","en":"The world’s nocturnal fullness also receives the name noon."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-947f5ac6e15b64c4a0445d01a338ce4c","tos.text-unit.sid-947f5ac6e15b64c4a0445d01a338ce4c"]},"form":"Mittag","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созревший Заратустра зовёт великий полдень.","en":"The ripe Zarathustra calls for great noon."}}]}
